==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 2

==Battleground==
*1 [[Dober P.D]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[Professor A.]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*1 [[Assassin Bear]] spawns after 900 seconds<sup>27,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
==='''Recommended Units'''===
*[[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Island Cat]]: If its level is at least 35, it is very effective at stalling and dealing damage. Send one out while cycling your other tanks/attackers to make the stage a lot easier.
*[[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Island Cat]]: Same as Manic Island, except you need higher levels. Have it at about level 50-55 for it to be as effective.
*[[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cyberpunk Cat]]: Can help with stalling the bosses. Using him alongside Manic island is probably most effective.
*[[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]]: Being a rusher, he can help kill Dober P.D more quickly, but he is only effective when Dober stands in front of Professor A.'s range.
*[[Crazed Titan Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Jamiera Cat]]: Really great here, takes a lot of punishment when level 30 or higher and deals great damage. Only downside is that he's a bit expensive. Have him at level 40 to make him more worth it.
*[[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Sushi Cat]]: Has the health to stall both bosses but works best when Dober P.D has been knocked back into Professor A's range. Use it exclusively for hard stalling because it doesn't do much damage.
*[[Lesser Demon Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Greater Balrog Cat]]: Plays the same role as A. Bahamut to get in and nuke the bosses. Is effective at a high level or with talents. With some luck, he can even get in on Professor A. for a quick kill.
*[[Radiant Aphrodite (Uber Rare Cat)|Radiant Aphrodite]]: Sits back and snipes Professor A. using Dober as a stepping stone for her Long-Distance. Use her to snipe the Professor and knock him back to make it easier to kill Dober.
*Any units that hit hard and have a LD that can hit Professor A will also help.

